 chica, que está                (sentarse) a la puerta, es la                (encargarse)\nde recoger los trabajos de casa de todos los alumnos y entregárselos al profesor.\n\n11.                  (Sentarse) en el sofá, la abuela ve cómo se le acerca su nieto de dos\n\naños, tan              (querer), con una flor              (coger) en el jardín de la\ncasa.\n12. La frase más                  (repetirse) entre marido y mujer es gracias, cariño.\n\n274\n\n","lines":[{"text":"现代西班牙语 学生用书1","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":238,"y0":142,"x1":707,"y1":183},"words":[{"text":"现","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":238,"y0":143,"x1":294,"y1":181}},{"text":"代","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":301,"y0":142,"x1":347,"y1":181}},{"text":"西","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":370,"y0":144,"x1":392,"y1":181}},{"text":"班","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":392,"y0":145,"x1":437,"y1":181}},{"text":"牙","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":458,"y0":144,"x1":470,"y1":181}},{"text":"语","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":477,"y0":145,"x1":497,"y1":182}},{"text":"学","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":537,"y0":143,"x1":579,"y1":182}},{"text":"生","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":579,"y0":138,"x1":621,"y1":198}},{"text":"用","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":620,"y0":146,"x1":640,"y1":183}},{"text":"书","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":665,"y0":144,"x1":685,"y1":183}},{"text":"1","confidence":94,"bbox":{"x0":695,"y0":147,"x1":707,"y1":180}}]},{"text":"10. ¿Estás                (regar) el Jardín? Está bien. Mientras haces esto, yo tiendo la ropa","confidence":95,"bbox":{"x0":364,"y0":305,"x1":1968,"y1":353},"words":[{"text":"10.","confidence":92,"bbox":{"x0":364,"y0":305,"x1":407,"y1":334}},{"text":"¿Estás","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":431,"y0":305,"x1":539,"y1":344}},{"text":"(regar)","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":804,"y0":308,"x1":920,"y1":346}},{"text":"el","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":935,"y0":308,"x1":963,"y1":338}},{"text":"Jardín?","confidence":79,"bbox":{"x0":974,"y0":308,"x1":1098,"y1":347}},{"text":"Está","confidence":97,"bbox":{"x0":1115,"y0